hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1043","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Chor ka haath chauthai deenaar ya us se zyada (ki chori) ke siwa na kaata jaye. (Muslim: 5/112). Baab: Us (cheez ki chori) mein haath kaatna jis ki qeemat teen dirham ho."
"1044","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik chor ka haath aik dhaal (ke churanay) par kaata jis ki qeemat teen dirham thi. (Muslim: 5/113). Baab: Anday (ki chori) mein haath kaatna. (Dhaal Arabi mein mijann kehlati hai.)"
"1045","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah chor par lanat karay, wo anda churata hai to us ka haath kaata jata hai aur wo rassi churata hai to us ka haath kaata jata hai. (Muslim: 5/113). Baab: Hudood mein sifarish karnay ki mumaniat."
"1046","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha), Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, se riwayat hai ke Quraish ko us Makhzoomi aurat ke muamlay ne fikr mein daal diya jis ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein ghazwa-e-Fatah mein chori ki thi, to unhon ne kaha: Us ke baaray mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaun baat karay? To unhon ne kaha: Usama bin Zaid ke siwa kaun is ki jurrat kar sakta hai jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mehboob hain. To usay Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya gaya to Usama bin Zaid ne Aap se us ke baaray mein baat ki. (Muslim: 5/113). (Haashiya: Muslim ki aik riwayat mein Ibn Shihab ka izafa hai ke dhafeer se murad rassi hai; Makhzoomi ka lafz Muslim mein nahi.)"
